OL,3,GNEWSAM&S to fight council's #419k      
OL,4,Abusiness rates claim                   
OL,6,FMarks & Spencer has said it is not     
OL,7,Fliable for #419,000 of unpaid business 
OL,8,Frates linked to its former Leicester   
OL,9,Fcity centre store, a court has heard.  
OL,11,FLeicester City Council is pursuing the 
OL,12,Fretailer for an unpaid sum linked to   
OL,13,Fthe premises in Gallowtree Gate.       
OL,15,FM&S owns the building but closed the   
OL,16,Fflagship store in August 2024, and the 
OL,17,Fcouncil is seeking payment of          
OL,18,Foutstanding business rates from April  
OL,19,F2025 to March 2026.                    
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
